# Voice reference clips go here
# 
# Required files for MVP:
# - pilot_default.wav (10+ seconds, single speaker, clear audio)
# - controller_default.wav (10+ seconds, single speaker, clear audio)
#
# Custom voices can be added as:
# - pilot_male_01.wav, pilot_female_01.wav, etc.
# - controller_male_01.wav, controller_female_01.wav, etc.
#
# The TTS service will try custom voices first, then fall back to defaults.

